        <Desc>Workshare program - Christ Ministry Center maintained and expanded the Collective Impact Center a Co-Work center to harness the resources of existing small non-profit charities and churches in the San Diego area. This incubator co-working hub for social entrepreneurs pursuing positive impact for social, cultural and/or envoronmentl change provides shared workspace and and facilitates cooperation and support between the various agencies to enable them to more efficiently and effectively share resources to help the needy.</Desc>
